msgid "Mapping happens in QField on Android."
msgstr "يتم إجراء التعيين في QField على نظام Android."

#: app/templates/new_project_chooser.html:48
msgid ""
"The area is split into tasks of ~10 buildings each, using roads, rivers,\n"
"              railways and airstrips as boundaries."
